WEBVTT

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:06.630
It's finally done.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:10.780
That ultimately became 
a far greater task...

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.980
Doesn't it make you nostalgic?

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:19.130
I didn't foresee having to bring 
this back out into the world.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:24.430
You must know how dangerous this is.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:26.230
I do.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.770
I have been its guardian 
for all this time.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.240
But that may be

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:36.960
all the more reason why those 
children need it on their journey.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.880
As misfortune would have it.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.890
Oh, I don't believe so.

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:45.920
Men may appear to make the same 
mistakes, again and again,

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.650
but fate is not a flat circle.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.760
It is a spiral.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:56.350
They will not necessarily choose 
the same path you and I did.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:00.880
Here they come.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:09.580
For them to tear through 
my barrier so easily,

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.660
my powers must be 
considerably weakened.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:19.650
You will fight for me?

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:21.670
Either way, my fate is sealed.

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:25.910
Even more reason for 
you to go in peace.

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.280
Thank you.

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:33.210
I will not forget your 
devotion, old friend.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:46.330
I would have liked to have seen

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:50.580
your bashful smile with my own 
eyes, one last time.

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:55.090
<b><i>The Berserker Armor</i></b>

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:23.580
Huh?

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:25.670
Is something wrong?

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:30.730
No... For an instant, I thought I 
sensed my mistress's thoughts.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.860
Maybe you're just itching 
to hear Flora's praise!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.320
I bet the little witch 
Schierke's heroism

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:40.210
routing the demons will be 
a new legend around here.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.840
I don't think so...

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:48.500
<i>All I managed to do was 
to seal the trolls' lair.</i>

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:53.450
<i>I called forth a great power, 
but could not fully control it,</i>

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.980
<i>resulting in unnecessary destruction.</i>

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.240
<i>I am still inexperienced.</i>

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.780
I was amazed!

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.490
R-Right...

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:07.760
Hey, you have a wild 
look in your eyes.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.260
I think I've figured it out!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:15.820
<i>Truthfully, I don't really know if 
these people are my destiny.</i>

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:18.690
But...

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:24.070
Guts?!

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:27.870
Wh-What's wrong?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:30.280
Didn't your wound heal 
back in the church?

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.600
<i>This is...</i>

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.550
See, it's all closed up.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:38.720
No, this is a grievous wound.

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:39.280
Eh?

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.730
His physical wound has healed,

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:46.890
but it hasn't healed on his astral body.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:49.300
If we do nothing, he will weaken,

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.350
and his physical wound 
will reopen, as well.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:54.060
Oh, no!

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.630
We can save him, right?

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:59.570
If we hurry to my mistress and 
use her medicine, yes.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.810
Help me, everyone.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:07.310
It's no big deal...

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.270
I just felt faint for a second.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:15.360
I can lend my shoulder.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.580
Grudgingly.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:17.930
I'm fine.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:22.620
<i>Wounds inflicted on the astral 
body are wounds on the soul.</i>

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:25.310
<i>The pain should be acute 
enough to cause trauma.</i>

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.850
<i>He should not even be conscious.</i>

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:35.090
<i>Guts, what happened back there, 
after we had escaped?</i>

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:39.200
<i>That wound wasn't caused by a troll.</i>

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:44.450
<i>Even the protective charm 
I cast has been negated.</i>

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:48.380
<i>I landed a good blow with this</i>

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:53.360
<i>on a monster that pretends 
to be an angel.</i>

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.260
<i>What? How is that possible?</i>

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:03.010
<i>How can a mortal fight such 
a high-ranking astral being?</i>

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.000
<i>That sword...</i>

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:08.250
<i>Perhaps with its specialized power</i>

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:11.550
<i>against astral beings, developed with
 long use against them.</i>

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:16.900
Do not let yourself be beguiled 
by hidden miracles.

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:21.270
Open your eyes and see the 
truth before you, as well.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:25.510
He is still alive.

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:32.010
<i>What is this flow of od?</i>

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:33.610
<i>From the forest...</i>

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:35.770
<i>From the mansion!</i>

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.910
<i>The forest barrier has fallen!</i>

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.540
Casca?

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:45.480
Farnese and Casca, you wait here!

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:46.610
What's going on?

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:48.290
Troll stragglers?

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:53.050
Really bad things, far worse than 
trolls, are at the mansion.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.610
The old lady's in trouble.

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:57.840
It's them.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.430
<i>M-Mistress...</i>

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.560
Mistress!

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:18.180
You guys, stop her!

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.450
G-Got it!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:28.050
There's no doubt about it...

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.090
Those are...

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:32.750
Apostles.

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.090
Where'd you come from?

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.600
What?

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.430
We have a human among us.

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:56.790
Are you with the witch?

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.110
That hurt!

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:03.870
Look at you, swinging that huge sword,

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.120
getting all wobbly!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.230
You... Why are you here?

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:23.690
I have deep ties with the 
mistress of this mansion.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:24.820
Ties...

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:26.960
I see.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:29.390
That's why he was at the trolls' lair.

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:31.700
Who are you?

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:35.420
My name is not for the likes 
of you mere Apostles.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:40.400
Let us simply say that I 
oppose the God Hand.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.540
What the hell?!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:46.170
Wait, I remember him.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:52.440
You're the knight who appeared 
at our master's rebirth!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:55.120
<i>Master?</i>

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:59.070
I know you, too.

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:01.310
You are our master's sacrifice.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.940
You're one of the two who survived!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.310
<i>It can't be.</i>

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:12.190
Who would have thought I'd 
run into both of you here.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.260
I suppose it is fate.

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:16.940
Zodd...

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.120
Why are you here?

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:23.340
Wait, is the one you 
call your master...

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:25.180
It is no secret.

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:29.200
There is but one that inhuman things 
acknowledge as their master.

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:34.610
Sir Zodd...

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:40.960
Allow me, Grunbeld, 
to deal with this one.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:42.960
Very well.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.470
Much obliged.

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.960
I've heard much of you.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.930
Though a mere mortal,

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:53.190
you were strong enough 
to survive the eclipse.

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:56.170
The witch may be formidable,

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:59.820
but attacking an old woman 
concealed in a remote forest,

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:01.480
with these numbers,

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:06.250
hardly seems noble for a warrior.

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:11.490
That said, I pressed to 
assist in this task

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:16.840
as an opportunity to display 
my loyalty to the hawk.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:22.030
And now, I can face a 
warrior such as you.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:26.820
It was worth forcing myself to come.

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.410
<i>Griffith's orders?</i>

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:30.450
<i>Why care about her?</i>

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.850
I, Grunbeld, as a member of 
the Band of the Hawk,

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:38.400
challenge the Black Swordsman to a duel.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:39.990
<i>What?</i>

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:42.360
Let us begin.

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.610
<i>What did he say just now?</i>

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.540
<i>Band of the Hawk...?!</i>

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:52.490
Mistress!

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:58.540
Isidoro?

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.290
What're you doing, witch girl?!

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:02.810
Where's your magic?

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:03.970
But...

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:08.060
I'm so distraught, I can't 
use my spells well...

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.290
Mistress...

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.310
You two, get out of here now!

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:16.960
Serpico!

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:20.130
Can't that feather duster do 
something about the flames?

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.030
Ridiculous.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.770
It would only fan the flames!

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:26.200
<i>Mistress, where are you?</i>

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.840
<i>Please respond!</i>

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:29.720
<i>Schierke...</i>

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.090
Mistress!

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:36.340
<i>Listen well, my beloved disciple.</i>

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:39.830
<i>Take that to the Black Swordsman.</i>

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:42.130
<i>You don't mean...</i>

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.970
<i>What happened?</i>

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.460
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:46.330
<i>Hurry.</i>

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.200
<i>A most terrible foe draws near.</i>

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.220
<i>If you cannot get that to him, 
the swordsman will...</i>

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:55.600
<i>But your life is in danger, Mistress!</i>

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:57.100
Hey, what's going on?

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:59.960
<i>You knew this would happen.</i>

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:02.100
<i>My time has come.</i>

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:03.660
<i>But...</i>

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:05.810
<i>But this...</i>

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:08.180
<i>Not like this! It's too cruel!</i>

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:09.760
<i>It should be peaceful.</i>

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:12.570
<i>Not like this, enveloped in flames!</i>

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:16.240
<i>I have garnered enough 
karma to merit this end.</i>

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:22.950
<i>Being a mage, you know better 
than anyone how sinful it is</i>

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:26.960
<i>for a mortal to live so long, 
in defiance of time.</i>

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:28.960
But!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:34.480
<i>But I'll be so lonely...</i>

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:38.610
<i>I'll never take naps in the sun 
with my head on your lap,</i>

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.280
<i>or have tea with the golems again.</i>

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:44.190
<i>Everything will be gone...</i>

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.980
<i>Everything will go up in flames!</i>

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.690
Schierke...

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.250
<i>What a blow.</i>

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:11.300
<i>Though he's still in human form,</i>

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:14.510
<i>he's stronger than most Apostles.</i>

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:20.400
<i>How dare you use the name 
"Band of the Hawk"?!</i>

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:22.540
Oh?

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:35.490
<i>Shit... That cracked several ribs.</i>

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:38.300
That's an impressive sword.

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:43.280
Even after taking two blows from 
my hammer, it hasn't snapped.

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:48.030
But I am less impressed 
by your swordsmanship.

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:52.070
You're just being thrown about, 
without any resistance!

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:54.540
<i>Easy for you to say.</i>

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:56.310
<i>Without any armor, I'm...</i>

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:02.000
The fire dragon sure likes his games.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:05.860
Let's finish the job on our end.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.360
Take the witch's head—

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:10.380
That won't happen.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:13.620
You!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.320
Step aside.

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:19.380
He is mine.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.230
I gotta get him.

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:22.980
He killed one of us!

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.370
That's an order.

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:28.680
The rest of you, get the witch's head.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.980
Get to it!

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:38.420
You, leaving the midst of battle, 
to go after some woman?

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.500
How unlike you.

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:45.350
I remember that fighting 
was everything to you,

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:46.770
undying one.

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:49.330
Don't get me wrong.

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:53.440
I am the only one who 
can keep you at bay.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.760
That is all there is to it.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:15:01.540
So things are a little different 
than usual for both of us.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:05.340
Oh?

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.000
Kids?

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.670
The witch's disciple?

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.160
Wh-What the hell?

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:13.300
More monsters, just when 
we've dealt with trolls?

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:15.670
He's an Apostle.

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:18.620
Hey, if you want to live,

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.480
tell us where the witch is.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:23.050
Though I guess you'll 
all die in the fire.

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:29.820
Curse you!

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:35.820
This way.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.010
We must get out of here.

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:39.300
It may seem cruel,

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:41.930
but if we try to rescue Flora, 
we'll only die, as well!

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:43.830
We're going to the treasure room.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.830
Something is there that 
I must get to Guts!

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:49.870
<i>I understand, Mistress.</i>

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.640
<i>If that is your wish.</i>

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:58.620
<i>I do not know if he is my destiny.</i>

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:04.080
<i>But as a mage, I am the only 
one who can save him.</i>

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:09.620
<i>Only I, disciple of the witch Flora, 
of the forest of the spirit tree.</i>

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:12.850
Here.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:16.100
Is the protective charm what 
you need to get to him?

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:19.420
Yes, but that isn't all there is to it.

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:22.860
My mistress cast the charm 
on a certain relic.

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:25.840
It is a very dangerous 
and powerful relic.

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:32.380
Weak!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:38.590
Are you truly the Black 
Swordsman they speak of?

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:42.950
The one who's struck down 
countless Apostles

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.390
and equaled Zodd the Immortal?

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:46.900
Our fated foe,

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.020
a weakling like you?

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:50.590
Answer me!

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.920
Sir Zodd is fortunate to have met

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:59.780
such a formidable opponent.

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:05.070
To a warrior, the battlefield 
is sacred ground.

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:09.030
Facing death amidst carnage 
is a warrior's desire.

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:15.730
But you are unworthy of a warrior's 
honor being wagered upon you.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:20.070
Why is a monster acting like a warrior?

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:22.060
You're just full of yourself.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:30.020
You are unworthy of a warrior's 
death by my hammer.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:33.280
Die in pieces!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:43.080
<i>These guys...</i>

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.130
Damn golems!

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:53.220
<i>Schierke?</i>

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:55.000
<i>Is the old lady all right?</i>

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.650
<i>You're saying to go inside?</i>

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:03.190
<i>What's in there?</i>

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:07.600
I see.

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:27.160
This is terrible.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:31.000
Like Schierke said, his wounds 
have reopened...

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.750
We have no way to deal with them.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:34.380
What now?

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.870
In his state, he couldn't do 
anything, even with armor!

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:39.500
If we stay too long, the fire 
will spread here, too!

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:41.520
<i>True...</i>

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:45.180
<i>If he dons the armor in this state, 
his life will be in danger.</i>

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:45.760
<i>But...</i>

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:49.250
Witch!

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:50.520
Where are you, witch?

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.520
Shit, it's them!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.800
I think it's time to get out of here.

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.010
Stay as long as you'd like.

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:59.690
<i>I must do something with my magic.</i>

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:03.780
<i>It's my responsibility for 
endangering them.</i>

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:11.260
Huh? What's this?

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:13.050
Are you sure this'll do anything?

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:13.940
I-I'm stunned! 
This grid's stunning me!

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.960
What will having him in 
this stupid armor do?

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:18.290
We have to trust Schierke!

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.310
Damn it! Not my problem!

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:30.060
Here it comes!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.560
Enough trickery...

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.790
Where have you hidden, 
Black Swordsman?

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:42.680
How far will you go to 
disgrace yourself?

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:45.800
What?

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:51.090
Help!

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.220
It hurts...

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:54.660
I ate him...

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:57.110
He should be dead...

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.530
That's...

00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:33.810
W-Wow...

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:41.980
H-He's more than just strong!

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:43.120
What's going on?

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:45.720
He couldn't even stand earlier.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.750
That was mean...

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.200
With something like that,

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:52.150
you should have given 
it to him for the trolls.

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:56.640
It isn't so simple a thing.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:58.650
Is it really him?

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:02.390
His movements are completely different.

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:05.640
But that sword is indeed his.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:07.100
That's...

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.010
How familiar, my fated foe.

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:16.570
You would have him tread 
the same path as you?

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:19.660
The same demented, demonic path?

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:23.600
<i>What's going on with this armor?</i>

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:29.670
<i>The moment I put it on, 
all the pain went away.</i>

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:33.830
<i>Rather,</i>

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:37.110
<i>I don't care about pain anymore.</i>

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:40.760
<i>What's more important than pain</i>

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:46.210
<i>is this impulse that's rising within me.</i>

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:51.210
<i>I feel something violent, 
boiling up from within.</i>

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:53.650
Let go...

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:54.480
<i>I see.</i>

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.890
Let go.

00:21:55.700 --> 00:21:56.780
<i>This...</i>

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:58.550
Let go of everything.

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:00.090
<i>This is my...</i>

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:01.460
Let go.

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:05.030
Let go of everything.

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:07.830
Let go!

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.190
The armor's changing!

00:23:56.990 --> 00:24:00.910
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.460
<b>I was within an unbelievable story.</b>

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.050
<b>That is the Hawk of Light.</b>

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:13.340
<b>Make sure you see it for yourself.</b>

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.510
<b>I do not know if he is my destiny.</b>

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.520
<b>May the spirits' 
blessings be with you.</b>

00:24:23.940 --> 00:24:27.010
<b><i>Next Time
The Witch's Recollection</i></b>
